<title>BAHRAIN: Taib Bank reports record 96 net,lifts div.</title>
<headline>Taib Bank reports record 96 net,lifts div.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income	     10.4    vs   9.7</p>
<p> Net operating income 11.9    vs  11.6</p>
<p> Provisions		1.5    vs   1.9</p>
<p> Dividend		  5.1    vs   4.2</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 107.9    vs 103.9</p>
<p> Customer deposits    84.4    vs 51.4</p>
<p> Assets		  333.6    vs 306.9</p>
<p>Full Name: Taib Bank EC.</p>
<p>Note - The Bahrain-based bank is an international investment and merchant bank.</p>
</text>
